<section class="framework" aria-labelledby="framework-title">
	<header class="framework-head">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">One question, two worlds</p><h2 id="framework-title">How do machines <em>evolve?</em></h2></div>
		<span>We build agents that turn new tasks, feedback, and tools into capabilities they did not have before.</span>
	</header>

	<div class="world-loop" aria-label="Digital and physical agents share one evolution loop">
		<div class="world">
			<span>01 / Simulation</span>
			<strong>Digital world agents</strong>
			<small>Interact at scale, shape societies, and learn from influence.</small>
		</div>
		<div class="loop-graphic" aria-hidden="true">
			<svg viewBox="0 0 380 126">
