			</svg>
			<span>Experience → policy → capability</span>
		</div>
		<div class="world world-right">
			<span>02 / Reality</span>
			<strong>Physical world agents</strong>
			<small>Perceive space, compose skills, and improve through correction.</small>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="pillars">
		<article class="pillar">
			<div class="pillar-title">
				<span>01</span>
				<div><small>Reuse what is known</small><h3>Compositional<br />Generalization</h3></div>
			</div>
			<p>Recombine learned skills to solve tasks never seen during training—to learn by analogy, not memorization.</p>
			<div class="mini-flow compose" aria-hidden="true">
				<i>A</i><i>B</i><b>+</b><i>C</i><span></span><strong>New task</strong>
