				<li><strong>MA-VLA</strong><span>Atomic skills for multi-arm collaboration</span></li>
				<li><strong>MACG</strong><span>Coming soon</span></li>
			</ul>
		</article>

		<article class="pillar featured">
			<div class="pillar-title">
				<span>02</span>
				<div><small>Learn from action</small><h3>On-policy<br />Learning</h3></div>
			</div>
			<p>Let agents act, receive feedback, and update from experience collected by their own evolving policy.</p>
			<div class="mini-flow policy" aria-hidden="true">
				<i>Act</i><span></span><i>Feedback</i><span></span><i>Adapt</i>
			</div>
			<ul>
