				<li><strong>Real-world Arm DAgger</strong><span>Human corrections · Coming soon</span></li>
				<li><strong>OASIS Interaction Reward</strong><span>Learn to interact and gain influence · Coming soon</span></li>
			</ul>
		</article>

		<article class="pillar">
			<div class="pillar-title">
				<span>03</span>
				<div><small>Expand what is possible</small><h3>Open-ended<br />Tool Ecosystem</h3></div>
			</div>
			<p>Build an open-ended multimodal tool ecosystem, connecting perception, reasoning, creation, and action through a growing network of tools.</p>
